<title>SWEDEN: Astra sees no sales lift from wider Prilosec use.</title>
<headline>Astra sees no sales lift from wider Prilosec use.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish/U.S. drugs group Astra AB on Monday said the FDA's approval for a wider use of its drug Prilosec, also known as Losec, would probably not boost the sales growth of the drug.</p>
</text>
